{"observed_at": "2026-11-05T21:31:29.741362+00:00", "provider": "OpenAI Responses API", "requested_model": "gpt-6-sol", "question_id": "G08", "category": "broad_intent", "brand_prompted": false, "prompt": "영어 쉐도잉 공부 방법 알려줘.", "repeat": 1, "search_mode": "required web_search, medium, KR", "max_tool_calls": 3, "consumer_chatgpt_measurement": false, "measurement_type": "discovery", "status": "completed", "model": "gpt-6-sol", "answer": "**영어 쉐도잉은 짧은 음성을 듣고, 말하는 사람의 발음·강세·리듬을 따라 말하는 연습**이에요. 처음에는 문장마다 멈춰 따라 하고, 익숙해지면 음성을 멈추지 않고 바로 뒤따라 말해 보세요. ([takeielts.britishcouncil.org](https://takeielts.britishcouncil.org/blog/how-to-improve-english-pronunciation-ielts-speaking?utm_source=openai))\n\n**하루 10분 연습법**\n1. **30초~1분짜리 음성**을 고릅니다. 대본이 있고 대체로 이해되는 내용이 좋아요.\n2. 대본을 보며 듣고, 모르는 표현의 뜻을 확인합니다.\n3. 한 문장씩 **듣기 → 멈추기 → 따라 말하기**를 반복합니다.\n4. 익숙해지면 음성을 틀어 놓고 **조금 늦게 따라 말합니다**. 단어 하나하나보다 강세와 리듬에 집중하세요. ([takeielts.britishcouncil.org](https://takeielts.britishcouncil.org/blog/how-to-improve-english-pronunciation-ielts-speaking?utm_source=openai))\n5. 내 목소리를 녹음해 원음과 비교하고, 가장 다른 부분 **한 가지만** 고쳐 다시 말합니다. 녹음 후 발음이 어려웠던 부분을 찾아 고치는 방식이 권장됩니다. ([learnenglish.britishcouncil.org](https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/english-levels/improve-your-english-level/five-tips-busy-learners-listening-speaking?utm_source=openai))\n\n**막히면 속도를 낮추세요.** 놓친 말을 확인할 때는 0.75배속으로 듣거나 대본과 비교한 뒤, 다시 자연스러운 속도로 연습하면 됩니다. ([learnenglish.britishcouncil.org](https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/level/improve-your-english-level/how-can-i-improve-my-english-pronunciation?utm_source=openai))", "citations": [{"type": "url_citation", "end_index": 252, "start_index": 107, "title": "How to Improve Pronunciation in IELTS Speaking: Band 7+ Tips | British Council IELTS", "url": "https://takeielts.britishcouncil.org/blog/how-to-improve-english-pronunciation-ielts-speaking?utm_source=openai"}, {"type": "url_citation", "end_index": 599, "start_index": 454, "title": "How to Improve Pronunciation in IELTS Speaking: Band 7+ Tips | British Council IELTS", "url": "https://takeielts.britishcouncil.org/blog/how-to-improve-english-pronunciation-ielts-speaking?utm_source=openai"}, {"type": "url_citation", "end_index": 870, "start_index": 691, "title": "Five tips for busy learners: listening and speaking | LearnEnglish", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/english-levels/improve-your-english-level/five-tips-busy-learners-listening-speaking?utm_source=openai"}, {"type": "url_citation", "end_index": 1120, "start_index": 950, "title": "How can I improve my English pronunciation? | LearnEnglish", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/level/improve-your-english-level/how-can-i-improve-my-english-pronunciation?utm_source=openai"}], "usage": {"input_tokens": 8705, "input_tokens_details": {"cache_write_tokens": 16, "cached_tokens": 4336}, "output_tokens": 445, "output_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 76}, "total_tokens": 9150}, "search_calls": [{"id": "ws_020b26ccf53f72d7016aecf5b3323087d2b134bfe5fac5a3d4", "type": "web_search_call", "status": "completed", "action": {"type": "search", "queries": ["site:britishcouncil.org shadowing technique English pronunciation listening repeat audio", "site:cambridge.org shadowing second language pronunciation study listening speaking"], "query": "site:britishcouncil.org shadowing technique English pronunciation listening repeat audio", "sources": [{"type": "url", "url": "https://takeielts.britishcouncil.org/blog/how-to-improve-english-pronunciation-ielts-speaking"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/level/improve-your-english-level/how-can-i-improve-my-english-pronunciation"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://englishonline.britishcouncil.org/blog/articles/8-practical-ways-to-practise-speaking-english/"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://americas.britishcouncil.org/new-ways-of-teaching/events/teaching-english-pronunciation-online"}, {"type": "url", "url": "https://takeielts.britishcouncil.org/blog/english-immersion